#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:1
msgid "Deployment failure checks and queue monitoring"
msgstr "部署失败检查与队列监控"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:3
msgid ""
"Every activation must pass the exact-SHA readiness fence. The control-"
"plane wait allows 900 seconds (`SHARED_READY_TIMEOUT`) for cold host "
"builds; host-local checks keep a 120-second budget after the build. When "
"an Actions deployment sets `DEPLOY_PEER_JOB`, "
"[`deploy/watch_peer.py`](../../deploy/watch_peer.py) watches the peer "
"host job in the current run attempt during the read-only readiness wait. "
"A failed or cancelled peer ends the wait and removes its one-off "
"container; if the Actions API is unavailable, the bounded wait continues."
" The watcher never interrupts migrations or service replacement."
msgstr ""
"每次激活都必须通过确切 SHA 的就绪栅栏。控制平面的等待为主机冷构建留出 900 "
"秒（`SHARED_READY_TIMEOUT`）；构建完成后，主机本地检查仍有 120 秒的时限。Actions 部署设置了 "
"`DEPLOY_PEER_JOB` 时，[`deploy/watch_peer.py`](../../deploy/watch_peer.py) "
"会在只读的就绪等待期间，盯着当前这次运行尝试中的对端主机任务。对端失败或被取消时，等待结束，并删除它的一次性容器；Actions API "
"不可用时，有时限的等待照常继续。这个监视程序永远不会打断迁移或服务替换。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:12
msgid "Drain through both activations"
msgstr "两次激活期间一直保持排空"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:14
msgid ""
"A single-host rollout that must not interrupt work drains one named host "
"through a database-backed admission fence. The orchestrator runs on the "
"control-plane machine, outside the pool:"
msgstr "不能中断工作的单主机上线，会通过一个基于数据库的准入栅栏排空一台指定的主机。编排程序运行在控制平面机器上，不在主机池内："

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:18
msgid ""
"It reads the host's current owner token and `drain_fence_epoch` and asks "
"the API to replace that pair with a fresh opaque owner token. The "
"database accepts only if both are still current, and rotates the epoch on"
" commit."
msgstr ""
"读取这台主机当前的所有者令牌和 `drain_fence_epoch`，请求 API "
"用一个新的不透明所有者令牌替换这一对值。只有两者都仍是当前值时数据库才会接受，并在提交时轮换 epoch。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:21
msgid ""
"It waits until the host reports `draining` and `slots_used=0`. A claim "
"committed just before the drain finishes; no later claim can commit while"
" the host is draining."
msgstr "等到这台主机报告 `draining` 且 `slots_used=0`。排空前刚提交的认领会正常完成；主机处于排空状态时，之后的认领都无法提交。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:24
msgid ""
"It activates the host with the fence in place, then the control plane "
"with `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAINING_HOST` set to the host's enrollment name. The "
"readiness check then accepts only that draining host, with zero occupied "
"slots, the target deployment capability, a fresh heartbeat and a "
"successful reverse sandbox manager probe, and rereads them after the "
"network wait. If new-chat placement is pinned to another host, that host "
"must be online at the target commit. Ordinary readiness accepts only "
"online hosts."
msgstr ""
"在栅栏保持的情况下激活主机，然后激活控制平面，并把 `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAINING_HOST` "
"设为这台主机的注册名。这时就绪检查只接受这一台正在排空的主机，要求它没有占用的槽位、具备目标部署能力、有新的心跳且反向 sandbox "
"manager 探测成功，并在网络等待之后重新读取这些条件。如果新对话的放置固定在另一台主机上，那台主机必须在线且处于目标 "
"commit。普通的就绪检查只接受在线的主机。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:31
msgid ""
"It releases the fence with the same owner token, which puts the host back"
" online."
msgstr "用同一个所有者令牌释放栅栏，让主机重新上线。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:34
msgid ""
"Acquire and release retries are idempotent, even after a lost response. A"
" successor takes over only from the exact token and epoch it observed; an"
" operator action, a lifecycle, credential or placement change, or a "
"competing rollout rotates the epoch, and the stale request fails. The "
"database refuses to delete a host while its fence is active, so drain "
"safety does not depend on deployments being serialized or on operators "
"leaving the row alone."
msgstr ""
"获取和释放的重试都是幂等的，即使响应丢失也一样。后继者只能从它观察到的确切令牌和 epoch "
"接管；运维人员的操作、生命周期、凭据或放置的变化，以及相互竞争的上线，都会轮换 "
"epoch，过期的请求随之失败。栅栏有效期间，数据库拒绝删除这台主机，所以排空的安全性既不依赖部署串行执行，也不依赖运维人员不去动这一行。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:41
msgid ""
"On cancellation or an uncertain result, fail closed: leave the host "
"draining and retry with the same owner. Queued work waits; a running turn"
" is never killed or replayed. Migration `0051_host_drain_fence_epoch` and"
" the `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2` recipe marker are the rollback floor; "
"`deploy.sh` still carries the V1 marker for older orchestrators."
msgstr ""
"取消或结果不确定时，以安全方式失败：让主机保持排空，用同一个所有者重试。排队的工作等待；正在运行的轮次绝不会被终止或重放。迁移 "
"`0051_host_drain_fence_epoch` 和配方标记 `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2` "
"是回滚的下限；`deploy.sh` 仍带着 V1 标记，供较旧的编排程序使用。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:47
msgid "Reaching the fence without a credential"
msgstr "不用凭据也能操作栅栏"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:49
msgid ""
"The orchestrator can read the pool and hold the fence through the admin "
"API (`GET /admin/agent/runner-hosts`, `POST …/<host>/drain` and "
"`…/undrain`), which needs `ADMIN_TOKEN`. On the control-plane machine it "
"can instead run the same operations in the control-plane container, which"
" already holds the database credential, so the deployment needs no static"
" administrator credential:"
msgstr ""
"编排程序可以通过管理 API（`GET /admin/agent/runner-hosts`、`POST …/<host>/drain` 和 "
"`…/undrain`）读取主机池并持有栅栏，这需要 "
"`ADMIN_TOKEN`。在控制平面机器上，它也可以改在控制平面容器里执行同样的操作；这个容器本来就持有数据库凭据，所以部署不需要静态的管理员凭据："

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:61
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`drain` and `undrain` read the API's request body on standard input, "
"never as arguments, which any process on the machine can read. Each "
"command prints the `GET /admin/agent/runner-hosts` document. A refusal "
"prints `{\"status\", \"code\", \"detail\"}` on standard error, with the "
"status the API would answer, and exits 2. The audit trail records "
"`agent.runner_host.drain` and `agent.runner_host.undrain` with the actor "
"`service:deployment-drain`."
msgstr ""
"`drain` 和 `undrain` 从标准输入读取 API "
"的请求体，绝不通过命令行参数传入，因为机器上的任何进程都能读到参数。每条命令都会输出 `GET /admin/agent/runner-"
"hosts` 返回的文档。被拒绝时，在标准错误输出 `{\"status\", \"code\", \"detail\"}`（状态码与 API "
"的应答相同），并以 2 退出。审计记录以操作者 `service:deployment-drain` 记下 "
"`agent.runner_host.drain` 和 `agent.runner_host.undrain`。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:68
msgid "Before stopping a serving runner"
msgstr "停掉正在服务的 runner 之前"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:70
msgid ""
"Source and artifact deployments resolve the candidate runner image "
"through Compose and run `cloud_agent_host.candidate_check` before "
"stopping the old runners. The candidate has no network, enrollment state,"
" sandbox manager token or live stack mounts besides the Docker socket. It"
" creates and removes a temporary guest on network `none`, checks kernel "
"isolation and the guest observer, and compares the **built image's** "
"runtime and helper labels with its pins. If it fails, the old readiness "
"marker and runners stay in place. The new runners, relays and sandbox "
"manager must still pass their live checks before `mark-ready`; a later "
"failure uses the recorded-generation recovery path."
msgstr ""
"源码部署和制品部署会通过 Compose 解析候选 runner 镜像，并在停止旧 runner 之前运行 "
"`cloud_agent_host.candidate_check`。候选容器没有网络、注册状态和 sandbox manager 令牌，除了 "
"Docker socket 之外也不挂载正在运行的服务。它在 `none` "
"网络上创建并删除一个临时客户机，检查内核隔离和客户机观察程序，并把**构建出的镜像**上的运行时和辅助程序标签与自己的固定版本对比。检查失败时，旧的就绪标记和"
" runner 保持不动。新的 runner、中继和 sandbox manager 仍须在 `mark-ready` "
"之前通过实时检查；之后的失败走按记录的代恢复的路径。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:80
msgid ""
"The stop signal drains the host service: it stops claiming and waits for "
"each turn child to finish its turn, without forwarding the signal to the "
"children."
msgstr "停止信号会排空主机服务：它停止认领，等待每个轮次子进程完成自己的轮次，并且不把信号转发给子进程。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:83
msgid "Host runtime qualification"
msgstr "主机运行时的资格验证"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:85
msgid ""
"The host service runs the full Kata probe at startup, whenever the "
"sandbox image or the runtime epoch changes, and at least every 30 "
"minutes; a Docker restart also restarts the runner, which probes again. A"
" failed qualification stops claims, logs once and retries after five "
"seconds, backing off up to five minutes. Updating or malformed epoch "
"evidence blocks acceptance (see [Kata runtime qualification "
"generation](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#kata-runtime-qualification-generation))."
" Probe containers carry `org.freeinference.chat-probe-created`, so the "
"sandbox manager never adopts them as chats, and each probe removes "
"abandoned probe containers in its namespace that are over an hour old."
msgstr ""
"主机服务会在启动时、沙箱镜像或运行时 epoch 变化时，以及至少每 30 分钟，执行一次完整的 Kata 探测；Docker 重启也会重启 "
"runner，从而再次探测。资格判定失败会停止认领，记录一次日志，五秒后重试，退避时间最长五分钟。处于更新中或格式错误的 epoch "
"会阻止接受轮次（见 [Kata 运行时资格代号](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#kata-runtime-qualification-"
"generation)）。探测容器带有 `org.freeinference.chat-probe-created`，所以 sandbox "
"manager 永远不会把它们当作对话接管；每次探测都会删除自己命名空间中超过一小时的遗弃探测容器。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:95
msgid ""
"The host passes its verdict to each turn child. The child rereads the "
"epoch, declines during an update, probes for itself if the epoch changed,"
" and checks the host network before accepting the turn. Without an epoch,"
" every turn runs the full probe, as do deployment canaries."
msgstr ""
"主机把判定结果交给每个轮次子进程。子进程会重新读取 epoch，更新期间拒绝轮次，epoch 变化时自己探测，并在接受轮次之前检查主机网络。没有 "
"epoch 时，每个轮次都执行完整探测，部署金丝雀也是如此。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:100
msgid "Network verification and startup work"
msgstr "网络核实与启动阶段的工作"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:102
msgid ""
"The host service keeps the network guard verification from its startup "
"check fresh, renewing it between claims once it is 35 seconds old (or at "
"a handover once it is 45 seconds old), and passes it to each turn child. "
"The child declines the turn unless that verification is present and "
"successful. A child that starts after the guard's one-minute window logs "
"`network_guard_verification_aged_out` and installs and reads back the "
"rules itself. The sandbox manager verifies a group's bridge when it "
"starts a turn activation and returns `network_verified`, which the runner"
" trusts for one minute; terminals and workspace operations always check. "
"The sandbox manager also installs and reads back the rules before any "
"group joins its bridge."
msgstr ""
"主机服务让启动检查得到的网络防护验证保持新鲜：验证满 35 秒后在两次认领之间续期（或在交接时满 45 "
"秒后续期），并把它交给每个轮次子进程。只有这份验证存在且成功，子进程才接受轮次。启动时已超出防护一分钟窗口的子进程，会记录 "
"`network_guard_verification_aged_out`，自己安装并回读规则。sandbox manager "
"在开始一次轮次激活时验证组的网桥，返回 `network_verified`，runner "
"在一分钟内信任这个结果；终端和工作区操作每次都会检查。sandbox manager 还会在任何组加入网桥之前安装并回读规则。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:113
msgid ""
"A new chat's repository is cloned and archived on the host while its "
"container starts; the `checkout` measurement includes the remaining clone"
" wait (`source_wait`) and import (`source_import`). Startup measurements "
"cover claim request through prompt dispatch, with qualification under "
"`preflight`, and exclude queue wait and model time. A host at capacity "
"claims again as soon as a turn's child exits or an environment test ends;"
" failing that, it checks after a second, or five seconds while an "
"environment test holds one of its slots."
msgstr ""
"新对话的仓库在容器启动的同时，在主机上克隆并打包成归档；`checkout` "
"测量包含剩余的克隆等待（`source_wait`）和导入（`source_import`）。启动测量覆盖从认领请求到发送提示词的过程，资格判定计入"
" "
"`preflight`，不包括排队等待和模型耗时。满载的主机在某个轮次子进程退出或环境测试结束时会立即再次认领；否则一秒后再检查，有环境测试占着槽位时则是五秒后。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:121
msgid "Empty-queue waits and CI evidence"
msgstr "队列为空时的等待，以及 CI 的证据"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:123
msgid ""
"After an empty claim, the host calls `/v1/agent/worker/wait`, which "
"returns when Postgres reports queued, requeued or ended work, or after "
"five seconds; the host then claims again. Changes the triggers cannot "
"see, such as a moved placement pin or a finished Fork, are still found "
"within five seconds. If the endpoint answers 404, the host polls and "
"retries the endpoint after five minutes, so hosts can deploy before the "
"control plane."
msgstr ""
"认领为空后，主机调用 `/v1/agent/worker/wait`；它在 Postgres "
"报告有新排队、重新排队或结束的工作时返回，最多等五秒，然后主机再次认领。触发器看不到的变化，比如放置固定位置的改变或 Fork "
"完成，也会在五秒内被发现。这个端点返回 404 时，主机改为轮询，五分钟后再尝试该端点，所以主机可以先于控制平面部署。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:130
msgid ""
"CI runs the candidate check on the real Kata host for reviewed `dev` "
"commits before `CI Gate` permits a release, using uniquely tagged images "
"and never the deployed stack; pull-request code does not run on that "
"machine. A local Docker test is not evidence that the Kata-host check "
"passed: use the named CI job's result."
msgstr ""
"对于经过审查的 `dev` commit，CI 会在 `CI Gate` 放行发布之前，在真实的 Kata "
"主机上运行候选检查；它使用带唯一标签的镜像，从不触碰已部署的服务，拉取请求的代码也不会在那台机器上运行。本地 Docker 测试不能证明 Kata"
" 主机上的检查已通过：请以那个 CI 任务的结果为准。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:136
msgid "Old process, candidate schema"
msgstr "旧进程对新 schema"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:138
msgid ""
"The Postgres CI job finds the latest `agent-*` release tag reachable from"
" the change's base and runs "
"[`scripts/check_rolling_upgrade.py`](../../scripts/check_rolling_upgrade.py)."
" It migrates a random `rolling_test_*` database with the previous "
"release's Alembic graph and warms that release's storage pool with "
"conversation reads and writes and with the writes a runner's turn makes: "
"a host heartbeat, the claim, a lease heartbeat, an event, the sandbox "
"reservation, residency, admission and settlement, and the terminal "
"transition, for a new chat and a follow-up. With the old process still "
"running, it applies the candidate migration and repeats those operations,"
" tests an idempotent migration retry, and removes the database."
msgstr ""
"Postgres CI 任务会找到从改动基线可达的最新 `agent-*` 发布标签，运行 "
"[`scripts/check_rolling_upgrade.py`](../../scripts/check_rolling_upgrade.py)。它用上一版本的"
" Alembic 迁移图迁移一个随机命名的 `rolling_test_*` 数据库，并用对话读写以及 runner "
"一个轮次会做的写入来预热那个版本的存储连接池：主机心跳、认领、租约心跳、事件、沙箱预留、residency、准入和结算，以及终结状态转换，新对话和后续消息各做一遍。在旧进程仍然运行的情况下，它应用候选迁移并重复这些操作，测试迁移的幂等重试，最后删除数据库。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:149
msgid ""
"Run it against disposable local Postgres, with an existing earlier "
"`agent-*` tag:"
msgstr "针对可丢弃的本地 Postgres 运行，使用一个已有的较早 `agent-*` 标签："

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:158
msgid ""
"It covers the common storage paths against the previous release only; "
"authenticated browser flows and older releases need separate evidence."
msgstr "它只针对上一版本覆盖常见的存储路径；需要认证的浏览器流程和更早的版本需要另外验证。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:161
msgid "Host and control plane one release apart"
msgstr "主机和控制平面相差一个发布"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:163
msgid ""
"Hosts deploy before the control plane, and managed compute hosts follow a"
" new control plane later, so each side talks to the other's previous "
"release for a while. When a change touches a backend package or the "
"locked dependencies, the same Postgres job runs "
"[`scripts/check_mixed_protocol.py`](../../scripts/check_mixed_protocol.py)"
" against the previous release. It runs four pairings, each on a random "
"`mixed_protocol_test_*` database migrated by its control plane: this host"
" with the previous control plane, the previous host with this control "
"plane, and each release with itself as the baseline."
msgstr ""
"主机先于控制平面部署，托管计算主机则在新控制平面之后才跟进，所以有一段时间，每一方都在和对方的上一版本通信。改动涉及后端包或锁定的依赖时，同一个 "
"Postgres 任务会针对上一版本运行 "
"[`scripts/check_mixed_protocol.py`](../../scripts/check_mixed_protocol.py)。它运行四种组合，每种都使用一个由其控制平面迁移过的随机"
" `mixed_protocol_test_*` "
"数据库：本版本主机配上一版本控制平面，上一版本主机配本版本控制平面，以及两个版本各自与自身组合作为基线。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:173
msgid ""
"In each pairing the real control plane serves on loopback, and the host's"
" real enrollment, claim and attempt client run a new chat's turn and two "
"follow-ups, a cancellation, settle, abandon and finish, and a stop and "
"residency eviction the control plane orders, against a scripted sandbox "
"manager. A pairing fails on a refused call, a message the receiver "
"rejects or would silently drop a field of, or a database that differs "
"from the baseline's. Four more pairings check the control plane's calls "
"to a host's sandbox manager (inventory, member status, group "
"registration, residency loss, SSH access push, terminal suspend and "
"resume) against each release's fake supervisor. No image, sandbox or "
"model runs, so this does not replace release acceptance or the Kata "
"check."
msgstr ""
"每种组合中，真实的控制平面在回环地址上提供服务，主机真实的注册、认领和 attempt 客户端针对一个脚本化的 sandbox "
"manager，运行一个新对话的轮次和两条后续消息、一次取消、结算、放弃和完成，以及控制平面下令的一次停止和 residency "
"驱逐。出现以下情况时组合失败：调用被拒绝；接收方拒收某条消息，或会悄悄丢掉其中的字段；数据库与基线不同。另外四种组合针对各版本的模拟 "
"supervisor，检查控制平面对主机 sandbox manager 的调用（清点、成员状态、组注册、residency 丢失、SSH "
"访问推送、终端挂起和恢复）。这里不运行镜像、沙箱或模型，所以不能代替发布验收或 Kata 检查。"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:184
msgid "Run it with the same tag as above:"
msgstr "用与上面相同的标签运行："

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:191
msgid "Detection after deployment"
msgstr "部署之后的检测"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md:193
msgid ""
"The main API runs one queue monitor; the MCP listener runs none. After "
"two consecutive observations a minute apart, it reports queue heads at "
"least ten minutes old:"
msgstr "主 API 运行一个队列监控，MCP 监听进程不运行。连续两次、间隔一分钟的观察之后，它会报告排队至少十分钟的队首工作："

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md
msgid "Event"
msgstr "事件"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md
msgid "`queued_without_host`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment-reliability.md
msgid ""
"Waiting work has no enrolled, fresh, compatible host, accounting for "
"retained ownership and the new-chat placement pin. A turn of a `cold` "
"sandbox counts any Host that restores, but not the Host it left while "
"that one still holds its container."
msgstr ""
"等待中的工作找不到可用的主机：没有已注册、心跳新、并且兼容的主机。判断时已经考虑了保留归属和新对话的放置固定。`cold` "
"沙箱的轮次，任何能做恢复的主机都算数，但它刚离开的那台主机只要还留着它的容器，就不算。"

